Keep the codebase organized.

Use this structure:
- components for reusable UI blocks
- sections for page sections
- data for static content
- lib for helpers
- hooks for custom hooks
- assets for media

Rules:
- split large pages into sections
- keep components small and readable
- use typed data objects for content
- avoid hardcoding repeated values
- keep animations isolated and reusable
- keep the main page composition clean
- production-ready code only